            "icon_width": 48,
            "subheading": "",
            "title": "Run The World From Home",
            "content": "<p>Explore scenic routes from around the globe—without stepping outside. With the WELLFIT App’s Virtual Run feature, you can jog through city streets, forest trails, or coastal paths in real time. It’s your passport to movement, bringing global fitness experiences straight to your home.</p>",
